# Supervisor wfi trapped by mstatus.TW, with mret return.
# Host setup preloads:
# - privilege = Supervisor
# - mtvec = 0x20
# - mstatus.TW set
# Mainline executes a gated wfi, the machine handler records
# mcause/mtval, skips the faulting instruction by advancing mepc,
# returns with mret, and supervisor code resumes at PC 0x4.
# Expect x10 = 1, x11 = 2, x12 = faulting instruction, x13 = 1.
